// review-119 H-1 / ttr-core#228 — a model-qualified short reference whose bare name is not unique:
// `md.revenue` beside a lexicon term `revenue` in the same package names the md measure (the
// slot-filling fallback reads the written model, D10). The md face: the measure.
package hartland.web
model md

def domain Money { type: decimal }
def measure revenue { domain: md.Money, aggregation: sum }
